                <div class="rendering rendering_researchoutput  rendering_researchoutput_vancouver rendering_contributiontojournal rendering_vancouver rendering_contributiontojournal_vancouver">Huisman GW, Wonink E, Meima R, Kazemier B, Terpstra P, Witholt B. <span class="title"><a rel="ContributionToJournal" href="https://research.rug.nl/nl/publications/metabolism-of-poly3-hydroxyalkanoates-phas-by-pseudomonas-oleovor/" class="link"><span>Metabolism of Poly(3-hydroxyalkanoates) (PHAs) by Pseudomonas oleovorans. Identification and Sequences of Genes and Function of the Encoded Proteins in the Synthesis and Degradation of PHA</span></a></span>. <span>The Journal of Biological Chemistry</span>. 1991 feb 5;266(4):2191-2198.</div>
